      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im still trying anymore. it feels like i just wake up every day to a mountain of debt and work that never ends and i just... i've failed at everything. my family, my career, everything. i'm just so tired of pretending i'm okay when it feels like there's actually no way out of this cycle.",
